  "goodToKnow": "Die Utopie is a utopia, an ideal society, and often a pipe dream: Das ist doch eine Utopie! Utopisch means utopian or unrealistic: utopische Preise (outrageous prices). Thomas More coined Utopia in 1516 from Greek ou-topos (no place). Die Dystopie is the dark opposite. Ernst Bloch's Das Prinzip Hoffnung is a key German philosophy of utopian thought. Plural: die Utopien."
